// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DataFiles 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P152144257" "Tarantula Data Files"
// DetailString :
"P4028565829" "These data files contain a great deal of information on the Arachnos-created Tarantulas. In the hands of someone with the right know-how, these data files can be used to replicate these creatures! These are worth a lot to the right people, but it would also mean an instant death sentence from Arachnos if they found out. While the payoff is tempting, it's probably better to return these to Regent Korol."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2305792241" "Those sneaky Crey! They managed to get out a data transmission to a nearby cargo ship! If this has information on how to make my lovely Tarantulas, they must be stopped! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Stop these Crey spies and recover the transmission data!</A>!"
// AcceptString :
"P1252394217" "Recover data from Crey spies"
// SendOffString :
"P1759649706" "Recover the data and punish the spies responsible for stealing it!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4293393090" "Have you recovered the information on my lovely Tarantulas yet? Do not delay!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
